{"step_index":6727,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-24T14:35:34Z","thinking":"Identifying distinct strength types is crucial for accurate matching; segregating these from pack size considerations streamlines the comparison logic. When a match is initially proposed, conflicting strengths (as indicated by the Arabic phrase, \"اختلاف صريح في التركيز (خط أحمر\") necessitate a \"no_match\" status to prevent incorrect item selection.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Update match_guards.py to enforce the new Decision Graph rules","EndLine":118,"Instruction":"Update guard_decision and measurement extraction to adhere to new approved rules","ReplacementContent":"STRENGTH_KINDS = {\"mass_mg\", \"volume_ml\", \"percent\"}\n\ndef strength_measurements(text):\n    \"\"\"Extracts only critical strengths/concentrations (mass, volume, percent).\n    Pack sizes (tablets, strips, counts) are excluded as they do not prevent matching.\n    \"\"\"\n    found = Counter()\n    for match in MEASURE.finditer(product_text(text)):\n        kind, factor = UNITS[match[\"unit\"]]\n        if kind in STRENGTH_KINDS:\n            found[(kind, Decimal(match[\"number\"]) * factor)] += 1\n    return found\n\n\ndef guard_decision(case, decision, catalog):\n    \"\"\"\n    Applies the new approved pharmaceutical Decision Graph:\n    1. Strength / Concentration is a RED LINE: Explicit conflict -> NO_MATCH.\n    2. Dosage Form: Different form with matching product and strength -> REVIEW.\n    3. Packaging / Pack Count / Bare Numbers / Price markers -> DO NOT prevent MATCH.\n    4. Reversal / OCR hints -> REVIEW.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = {\n        **decision,\n        \"model_status\": decision[\"status\"],\n        \"model_item_ids\": list(decision.get(\"item_ids\", [])),\n        \"model_reason\": decision.get(\"reason\", \"\"),\n        \"guard_notes\": []\n    }\n    by_id = {p[\"id\"]: p[\"name\"] for p in catalog}\n\n    if decision.get(\"status\") == \"match\":\n        req_strengths = strength_measurements(case[\"requested_name\"])\n        requested_forms = dosage_forms(case[\"requested_name\"])\n\n        valid_match_ids = []\n        for item_id in decision.get(\"item_ids\", []):\n            cand_name = by_id.get(item_id, \"\")\n            cand_strengths = strength_measurements(cand_name)\n            supplied_forms = dosage_forms(cand_name)\n\n            # Rule 1: Strength conflict is a RED LINE (NO_MATCH)\n            # If both have explicit strengths and they conflict\n            if req_strengths and cand_strengths and req_strengths != cand_strengths:\n                result[\"guard_notes\"].append(\n                    f\"اختلاف صريح في التركيز (خط أحمر): {case['requested_name']} vs {cand_name}\"\n                )\n                continue\n\n            # Rule 2: Dosage form conflict -> REVIEW (does not reject, but requires pharmacist review)\n            if requested_forms and supplied_forms and requested_forms != supplied_forms:\n                result[\"guard_notes\"].append(\n                    f\"نفس المنتج والتركيز ولكن مع اختلاف في الشكل الدوائي: مطلوب {requested_forms} والمخزن {supplied_forms}\"\n                )\n\n            valid_match_ids.append(item_id)\n\n        # Evaluate final status\n        if not valid_match_ids and decision.get(\"item_ids\"):\n            # All candidates failed the strength red line\n            result[\"status\"] = \"no_match\"\n            result[\"item_ids\"] = []\n            result[\"reason\"] = \"اختلاف صريح في التركيز يمنع المطابقة تماماً (خط أحمر).\"\n        elif any(\"اختلاف في الشكل الدوائي\" in note for note in result[\"guard_notes\"]):\n            result[\"status\"] = \"review\"\n            result[\"item_ids\"] = valid_match_ids\n            result[\"reason\"] = \" | \".join(result[\"guard_notes\"])\n        else:\n            result[\"item_ids\"] = valid_match_ids\n\n    elif decision.get(\"status\") == \"no_match\":\n        possible = [p[\"id\"] for p in catalog if reversal_hint(case[\"requested_name\"], p[\"name\"])]\n        if possible:\n            result[\"status\"] = \"review\"\n            result[\"item_ids\"] = possible\n            result[\"guard_notes\"].append(\"احتمال اسم بحروف عربية معكوسة مع تطابق بقية الرموز؛ يلزم فحصه.\")\n            result[\"reason\"] = \" | \".join(result[\"guard_notes\"])\n\n    return result","StartLine":67,"TargetContent":"def measurements(text):\n    found = Counter()\n    for match in MEASURE.finditer(product_text(text)):\n        kind, factor = UNITS[match[\"unit\"]]\n        found[(kind, Decimal(match[\"number\"]) * factor)] += 1\n    return found\n\n\ndef reversal_hint(request, candidate):\n    left, right = TOKENS.findall(normalize(request)), TOKENS.findall(normalize(candidate))\n    if len(left) != len(right):\n        return False\n    changed = False\n    for a, b in zip(left, right):\n        if a == b:\n            continue\n        if len(a) >= 4 and re.fullmatch(r\"[\\u0621-\\u064a]+\", a) and a == b[::-1]:\n            changed = True\n        else:\n            return False\n    return changed\n\n\ndef guard_decision(case, decision, catalog):\n    result = {**decision, \"model_status\": decision[\"status\"],\n              \"model_item_ids\": list(decision[\"item_ids\"]), \"model_reason\": decision[\"reason\"],\n              \"guard_notes\": []}\n    by_id = {p[\"id\"]: p[\"name\"] for p in catalog}\n    if decision[\"status\"] == \"match\":\n        required = measurements(case[\"requested_name\"])\n        for item_id in decision[\"item_ids\"]:\n            missing = required - measurements(by_id[item_id])\n            if missing:\n                result[\"guard_notes\"].append(\n                    \"الوصف المطلوب فيه قياس أو عدد صريح لم يثبت بنفس القيمة والوحدة في وصف المخزن: \" + item_id)\n            if bare_numbers(case[\"requested_name\"]) - bare_numbers(by_id[item_id]):\n                result[\"guard_notes\"].append(\"يوجد رقم إضافي في وصف الطلب لم تُثبت دلالته ومقابلته في وصف المخزن: \" + item_id)\n            requested_forms, supplied_forms = dosage_forms(case[\"requested_name\"]), dosage_forms(by_id[item_id])\n            if requested_forms - supplied_forms or (requested_forms and supplied_forms - requested_forms):\n                result[\"guard_notes\"].append(\"الشكل المذكور صراحةً في الطلب غير مثبت أو متعارض مع وصف المخزن: \" + item_id)\n        if result[\"guard_notes\"]:\n            result[\"status\"] = \"review\"\n    elif decision[\"status\"] == \"no_match\":\n        possible = [p[\"id\"] for p in catalog if reversal_hint(case[\"requested_name\"], p[\"name\"])]\n        if possible:\n            result[\"status\"] = \"review\"\n            result[\"item_ids\"] = possible\n            result[\"guard_notes\"].append(\"الكود وجد احتمال اسم بحروف عربية معكوسة مع تطابق بقية الكلمات والأرقام؛ يلزم فحصه.\")\n    if result[\"guard_notes\"]:\n        result[\"reason\"] = \" | \".join(result[\"guard_notes\"])\n    return result","TargetFile":"d:/AI_Engineer/Pharmacy/review/match_guards.py","toolAction":"Update match_guards.py","toolSummary":"Align match_guards with new business rules"}}]}
